Your box is done: I ran face-owner.js on it just now. The face is a contact, face-domain.json is face.spirit.andyflinn.com, and 'join' is granted to your node. One step is left, on spirit-3. Put this at the VERY TOP of /etc/caddy/Caddyfile, above the import line:
{
  on_demand_tls {
    ask http://127.0.0.1:65434/.well-known/spirit-name
  }
}
Then: caddy validate --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile --adapter caddyfile && systemctl reload caddy && /root/face/SpiritOS/bash/face-tls
Then from anywhere: curl -sS https://join.face.spirit.andyflinn.com/  The proof is a 501 last-leg-not-built naming your key. Paste me what it says.
